## Measurements

Each pair is timed with `pyperf timeit`, on random input and on the input that
is hard for the implementation it replaced, at sizes the baseline can answer.
`-o` and `--append` keep the runs under `benchmarks/<function>.json`, the JSON
records the setup and statement pyperf ran, and `pyperf compare_to` renders the
table. The setups listed under each table are read from those files.

